WEBVTT

00:00:00.460 --> 00:00:06.730
This story is one that lightly describes the ordinary daily lives of the three Minami sisters.

00:00:06.730 --> 00:00:09.340
Please don't expect too much from it.

00:00:09.340 --> 00:00:11.300
Also, watch in a bright room,

00:00:11.300 --> 00:00:14.990
and stay 3 meters away from the TV while watching.

00:00:22.040 --> 00:00:22.370
Kana

00:00:22.370 --> 00:00:22.710
Chiaki

00:00:22.710 --> 00:00:23.500
Haruka

00:01:45.060 --> 00:01:50.040
Neighbor Minami-san

00:01:59.610 --> 00:02:01.510
Touma's been coming home late recently.

00:02:01.960 --> 00:02:03.440
Does it matter?

00:02:03.440 --> 00:02:06.330
She's got her own friends to hang out with.

00:02:06.330 --> 00:02:09.100
This is after she made that new friend named Chiaki, right?

00:02:09.100 --> 00:02:11.810
She has the same surname as us, Minami.

00:02:15.830 --> 00:02:17.930
As long as she's not with bad company.

00:02:18.420 --> 00:02:23.280
Whenever Touma is coming home late, we get a call from the other Minami family.

00:02:23.280 --> 00:02:25.370
Bad company, eh?

00:02:25.370 --> 00:02:28.790
That explains why she has become more foul-mouthed lately.

00:02:28.790 --> 00:02:30.880
She's becoming more like a boy.

00:02:31.370 --> 00:02:33.780
Surrounded by her good-for-nothing brothers,

00:02:33.780 --> 00:02:36.300
It's no wonder she became more tomboyish than anyone else.

00:02:36.680 --> 00:02:40.340
Brothers, you say... Does that include you?

00:02:40.850 --> 00:02:42.210
Guy...

00:02:44.880 --> 00:02:49.120
Perhaps she found a guy she likes?

00:02:49.670 --> 00:02:53.560
If she liked some guy, wouldn't she become more feminine?

00:02:54.030 --> 00:02:58.000
In this case it's normal for her to become cold towards her family members, isn't it?

00:02:58.000 --> 00:03:00.970
I heard there are three siblings on the other side,

00:03:00.970 --> 00:03:03.020
So maybe there's a cool elder brother among them.

00:03:03.020 --> 00:03:04.160
I see.

00:03:10.210 --> 00:03:14.670
But, I think we have enough cool brothers here.

00:03:14.670 --> 00:03:16.260
What are you talking about, bro?

00:03:16.640 --> 00:03:20.420
You, follow Touma and go check out the other Minami family.

00:03:20.420 --> 00:03:22.430
Huh? Me?

00:03:22.430 --> 00:03:27.640
Anyway, Touma has had her meals there many times, so we have to express our gratitude for once.

00:03:28.320 --> 00:03:30.640
A veil of courtesy...

00:03:30.690 --> 00:03:32.690
The next day

00:03:33.010 --> 00:03:36.460
And so one of my brothers has followed me here,

00:03:36.460 --> 00:03:38.400
And he's waiting outside.

00:03:38.720 --> 00:03:39.930
What do we do?

00:03:39.930 --> 00:03:42.660
Either way, you really have it tough back in your house.

00:03:42.660 --> 00:03:44.410
I've been through a lot.

00:03:47.040 --> 00:03:49.910
Haruka doesn't look pleased.

00:03:49.910 --> 00:03:54.050
In any case, this means they don't trust us, right?

00:03:54.050 --> 00:03:56.430
Haruka, have you been listening to what I've been saying?

00:03:56.430 --> 00:03:57.870
Then what?

00:03:57.870 --> 00:04:01.410
Because my voice is more high-pitched over the phone they think I'm suspicious?

00:04:01.410 --> 00:04:03.760
Haruka, what I mean is,

00:04:03.760 --> 00:04:06.050
Touma's family is really interesting!

00:04:06.050 --> 00:04:11.610
Just let the one outside in here and her brothers' pointless worries will be no more.

00:04:13.180 --> 00:04:15.150
I'm Touma's brother, Akira.

00:04:15.150 --> 00:04:18.020
Thank you for taking care of my sister all this while.

00:04:18.330 --> 00:04:19.730
This isn't much, but-

00:04:25.580 --> 00:04:27.990
<i>This really isn't much.</i>

00:04:28.520 --> 00:04:31.870
Do you really think you can please us with just soap bars?

00:04:31.870 --> 00:04:34.210
You, the third brother who talks so much about the maiden's heart!

00:04:34.210 --> 00:04:36.170
Touma, what did you tell them?

00:04:36.170 --> 00:04:37.380
The truth.

00:04:37.380 --> 00:04:41.260
You think you can make our boss happy with soap?

00:04:41.870 --> 00:04:44.300
Wait, she's loosened up.

00:04:46.260 --> 00:04:52.440
If you want to know how Touma spends her time here, you should receive the same treatment as her.

00:04:52.440 --> 00:04:54.210
Right, boss?

00:04:54.210 --> 00:04:56.010
You can sit at ease.

00:04:56.010 --> 00:04:57.950
This is an order!

00:04:57.950 --> 00:04:58.910
Yes.

00:05:00.210 --> 00:05:02.490
Want to have your meal here with Touma?

00:05:02.490 --> 00:05:04.030
Don't leave any food on your plate!

00:05:04.030 --> 00:05:04.990
Yes...

00:05:05.310 --> 00:05:09.020
It isn't common to meet someone with the same surname, let's get along with each other.

00:05:09.020 --> 00:05:11.790
We'll teach you who is more worthy of the "Minami" name!

00:05:13.080 --> 00:05:15.540
I wasn't talking about that!

00:05:21.790 --> 00:05:23.220
I wonder if things are going well.

00:05:25.060 --> 00:05:26.050
It's the phone.

00:05:28.090 --> 00:05:29.590
Yes, this is Minami.

00:05:29.590 --> 00:05:32.580
Is this Minami Touma's Residence?

00:05:32.580 --> 00:05:34.060
Yes, that's right.

00:05:34.060 --> 00:05:38.200
I'm Minami Chiaki's elder sister, Haruka.

00:05:38.200 --> 00:05:41.210
We have Touma-san and Akira-kun in our care.

00:05:42.370 --> 00:05:43.070
Yes.

00:05:44.010 --> 00:05:45.360
Do not worry.

00:05:45.360 --> 00:05:48.020
Haruka, isn't your voice too low-pitched?

00:05:48.020 --> 00:05:49.010
Eh?

00:05:50.140 --> 00:05:51.330
Who is this?!

00:05:51.330 --> 00:05:53.200
This isn't a kidnapping!

00:05:53.200 --> 00:05:54.020
What's going on?!

00:05:54.020 --> 00:05:55.590
Erm... That's not it!

00:05:55.590 --> 00:05:57.010
Listen to me!

00:05:57.010 --> 00:05:57.880
Wait a moment!

00:05:57.880 --> 00:06:00.020
Hello? Hello?

00:06:01.220 --> 00:06:02.210
Minami-ke.

00:06:05.880 --> 00:06:09.090
Huh? How did we end up with this topic?

00:06:09.090 --> 00:06:12.430
Since we started talking about you wanting a girl.

00:06:13.040 --> 00:06:14.980
Did I say anything of that sort?

00:06:14.980 --> 00:06:17.320
Eh? No, it's a joke.

00:06:17.320 --> 00:06:19.000
Oh, a joke.

00:06:19.000 --> 00:06:20.390
Yup, a joke.

00:06:21.850 --> 00:06:23.550
You are absolutely right about that.

00:06:23.550 --> 00:06:24.880
I'm absolutely right?!

00:06:25.580 --> 00:06:29.610
I'm constantly thinking about how to get a girlfriend.

00:06:30.080 --> 00:06:33.750
I am especially serious during Math lessons.

00:06:34.380 --> 00:06:36.580
Do you want to look at my Math notes?

00:06:36.580 --> 00:06:38.160
It's awesome.

00:06:38.160 --> 00:06:42.040
Sounds like there's many dodgy Akira formulas written on them.

00:06:42.940 --> 00:06:44.800
Pi equals 2h.

00:06:48.560 --> 00:06:50.050
Forget that.

00:06:50.500 --> 00:06:53.110
Can you tell me what type of girl you like?

00:06:53.110 --> 00:06:55.310
Let's see...

00:06:56.070 --> 00:06:58.810
As long as it's not Kana-san, everyone is acceptable!

00:06:59.750 --> 00:07:00.500
Ouch!

00:07:00.820 --> 00:07:06.210
You have to be sure I hold no interest in you before saying something like that.

00:07:06.210 --> 00:07:07.750
Do things in sequence!

00:07:07.750 --> 00:07:09.690
I'm sorry! I'll follow the sequence!

00:07:09.690 --> 00:07:10.530
I'm sorry!

00:07:11.220 --> 00:07:13.030
What do you think about our Haruka?

00:07:13.030 --> 00:07:18.040
She's fine, but my first feeling towards her was fear...

00:07:21.980 --> 00:07:24.790
But I love her long hair.

00:07:30.780 --> 00:07:33.160
There's one over there who fits your description.

00:07:44.560 --> 00:07:46.820
<i>A rare expression by Fujioka-kun!</i>

00:07:46.820 --> 00:07:48.610
<i>Who IS that guy?</i>

00:07:48.610 --> 00:07:50.610
<i>He looks pretty close with Minami.</i>

00:07:50.610 --> 00:07:52.430
<i>How is he related to her?</i>

00:07:53.040 --> 00:07:56.000
<i>Alright. I'll start talking to Minami in a nonchalant manner,</i>

00:07:56.000 --> 00:07:58.370
<i>And ask about their relationship casually.</i>

00:07:58.370 --> 00:08:00.720
<i>Casually... Casually!</i>

00:08:05.540 --> 00:08:07.850
I know your preference now.

00:08:07.850 --> 00:08:10.110
Now you just need to leave everything to Kana-sama.

00:08:13.820 --> 00:08:15.520
<i>Who is that person?</i>

00:08:15.520 --> 00:08:18.060
<i>For some reason he's staring hard at me!</i>

00:08:18.600 --> 00:08:20.690
Kana-san, who is that?

00:08:21.790 --> 00:08:22.770
That guy?

00:08:22.770 --> 00:08:24.310
<i>Too close, too close, they're too close!</i>

00:08:25.090 --> 00:08:27.090
He's the Big Boss.

00:08:27.090 --> 00:08:28.630
B-Big Boss?

00:08:28.630 --> 00:08:31.060
His kick is really powerful.

00:08:39.520 --> 00:08:41.380
I... I'm gonna get kicked!

00:08:45.490 --> 00:08:47.700
<i>Huh? Something is wrong with the atmosphere.</i>

00:08:47.700 --> 00:08:51.800
<i>Even though I approached them casually, I can't start a casual conversation.</i>

00:08:55.300 --> 00:08:58.500
<i>That's the beautiful long-haired girl from just now.</i>

00:08:59.100 --> 00:09:00.310
<i>I get it.</i>

00:09:00.310 --> 00:09:02.940
<i>That person is the Big Boss's girlfriend,</i>

00:09:03.290 --> 00:09:06.770
<i>And because I was staring at her, the Big Boss got mad!</i>

00:09:07.430 --> 00:09:08.940
Please don't worry!

00:09:08.940 --> 00:09:11.460
I won't touch other people's girlfriends!

00:09:12.330 --> 00:09:13.280
That's right!

00:09:13.280 --> 00:09:17.030
If you ask me, I prefer someone more like Kana-san.

00:09:18.650 --> 00:09:20.560
Now if you excuse me.

00:09:26.790 --> 00:09:28.120
Wait a second, you.

00:09:28.960 --> 00:09:31.550
What you meant just now...

00:09:31.920 --> 00:09:33.800
Is that you want to fight it out with me, right?

00:09:35.550 --> 00:09:37.130
You got it wrong!

00:09:40.730 --> 00:09:42.060
By the way,

00:09:43.310 --> 00:09:45.770
can you tell me your class and name?

00:09:47.800 --> 00:09:50.380
Give me a break!

00:09:51.480 --> 00:09:53.780
<i>Fujioka-kun's rare expression!</i>

00:10:00.620 --> 00:10:03.880
Akira's been looking depressed lately.

00:10:03.880 --> 00:10:06.340
Your brother who came here last time?

00:10:06.340 --> 00:10:08.790
Perhaps something happened to him in school?

00:10:10.110 --> 00:10:12.950
Okay! I'll try to cheer him up.

00:10:12.950 --> 00:10:14.050
Please do, Kana.

00:10:15.210 --> 00:10:18.050
Take that! One more time!

00:10:18.400 --> 00:10:19.940
Hey hey, laugh!

00:10:19.940 --> 00:10:21.800
It's really funny, it's really funny!

00:10:24.720 --> 00:10:26.560
Laugh, laugh!

00:10:26.560 --> 00:10:27.680
<i>Rare expression!</i>

00:10:29.020 --> 00:10:29.640
It's really fun!

00:10:29.640 --> 00:10:30.560
<i>Rare expression!
It's really fun!</i>

00:10:30.560 --> 00:10:31.900
Here it comes, here it comes!

00:10:31.900 --> 00:10:32.500
That's it! That's it!

00:10:32.500 --> 00:10:33.690
<i>Rare expression!
That's it! That's it!</i>

00:10:33.690 --> 00:10:35.440
Minami-ke!

00:11:12.600 --> 00:11:14.820
Your name shall be Yamada.

00:11:16.070 --> 00:11:17.230
Take that!

00:11:21.460 --> 00:11:23.520
That's amazing!

00:11:23.520 --> 00:11:24.450
Isn't it?

00:11:25.050 --> 00:11:25.910
Take that!

00:11:30.410 --> 00:11:33.540
Give it your all, Yamada. We're reaching the summit soon.

00:11:33.540 --> 00:11:36.300
And you know, my husband...

00:12:00.440 --> 00:12:02.280
Don't scare me, you dumbass!

00:12:11.820 --> 00:12:13.420
Are you okay, Yamada?

00:12:22.080 --> 00:12:23.260
Take that!

00:12:29.010 --> 00:12:32.310
This is our last obstacle, Yamada.

00:12:32.310 --> 00:12:33.770
Here we go!

00:12:38.540 --> 00:12:40.430
Nice work, Yamada!

00:12:46.780 --> 00:12:47.870
Take that!

00:12:51.930 --> 00:12:53.260
My bad, Yamada.

00:12:53.260 --> 00:12:55.540
Yahoo! Chiaki!

00:12:56.370 --> 00:12:58.020
I'm going off first!

00:13:06.280 --> 00:13:07.390
Yamada!

00:13:08.480 --> 00:13:10.910
Yamada! Yamada!

00:13:16.590 --> 00:13:17.670
Yamada...

00:13:21.860 --> 00:13:23.460
Hey, hey, what's going on?

00:13:23.460 --> 00:13:27.290
To think that the gluttonous Chiaki-sama would lose her appetite.

00:13:27.290 --> 00:13:28.940
Is something the matter?

00:13:30.070 --> 00:13:33.920
Yamada left on a truck.

00:13:34.310 --> 00:13:35.280
School transfer?

00:13:35.280 --> 00:13:38.530
Well, if there are encounters, there will also be partings, right?

00:13:38.530 --> 00:13:40.670
It's all your fault, you dumbass!

00:13:40.670 --> 00:13:42.710
Huh? Why me?

00:13:42.710 --> 00:13:44.670
Kana, did you do anything?

00:13:44.670 --> 00:13:46.010
I don't know!

00:13:46.010 --> 00:13:48.680
I don't know Yamada!

00:13:48.680 --> 00:13:49.750
Kana!

00:13:49.750 --> 00:13:52.210
I really don't know anything!

00:13:52.210 --> 00:13:53.540
Yamada.

00:14:12.180 --> 00:14:14.580
Want to give volleyball a try?

00:14:19.580 --> 00:14:23.830
My second brother Natsuki was rebellious back then,

00:14:24.640 --> 00:14:27.830
But he became less aggressive after he joined a club.

00:14:27.830 --> 00:14:29.360
How about a second helping of rice?

00:14:29.360 --> 00:14:31.010
Oh, thanks.

00:14:31.010 --> 00:14:33.250
It's the volleyball club if I remember correctly.

00:14:33.250 --> 00:14:35.390
And he comes home early.

00:14:35.390 --> 00:14:38.870
Akira, you came here to fetch Touma, right?

00:14:39.300 --> 00:14:41.760
Why are you eating your meal here as well?

00:14:42.900 --> 00:14:44.770
No second helpings.

00:14:49.010 --> 00:14:50.140
Natsuki.

00:14:50.140 --> 00:14:52.550
Hosaka-senpai. Hey.

00:14:52.550 --> 00:14:53.990
Remain seated.

00:14:54.860 --> 00:14:56.620
Can you go for practice today?

00:14:56.620 --> 00:15:00.860
I'm sorry. I have to make meals.

00:15:00.860 --> 00:15:02.170
It's alright then.

00:15:02.170 --> 00:15:06.250
Anyway, try the lunch I made.

00:15:06.250 --> 00:15:07.240
Huh?

00:15:07.240 --> 00:15:08.860
Don't misunderstand.

00:15:09.530 --> 00:15:13.720
I want you to sample it to see if it's worthy of the woman I love the most.

00:15:14.110 --> 00:15:17.350
Oh I see. I really got a shock there.

00:15:18.100 --> 00:15:21.320
Will a woman be happy if you make her lunch?

00:15:21.320 --> 00:15:22.470
That should be the case.

00:15:22.470 --> 00:15:23.730
I'm sorry.

00:15:24.100 --> 00:15:27.090
I just ate and so I'm full right now.

00:15:27.090 --> 00:15:29.960
I don't think I can give a proper opinion.

00:15:29.960 --> 00:15:32.450
Isn't that your lunch there?

00:15:32.880 --> 00:15:35.780
These are supposed to be eaten later.

00:15:37.290 --> 00:15:40.000
You shouldn't open up what you're supposed to eat later, should you?

00:15:40.510 --> 00:15:41.750
That's true.

00:15:42.910 --> 00:15:44.620
You shouldn't be eating it now, right?

00:15:45.260 --> 00:15:46.210
That's true.

00:15:46.880 --> 00:15:50.720
<i>I won't understand what kind of taste women like anyway.</i>

00:15:51.230 --> 00:15:53.520
He keeps saying he doesn't understand women,

00:15:53.520 --> 00:15:56.720
And places women in the "mysterious creature" category.

00:15:57.260 --> 00:16:00.730
Our Natsuki really is unsociable.

00:16:05.400 --> 00:16:06.440
Hello?

00:16:07.140 --> 00:16:08.190
Hello!

00:16:08.500 --> 00:16:11.190
<i>She's gotten herself a weird underling.</i>

00:16:14.990 --> 00:16:19.020
Eh? Natsuki, what are you doing in a second-year classroom?

00:16:19.020 --> 00:16:24.060
Minami Haruka is taking care of my younger brother and sister in her house,

00:16:24.060 --> 00:16:25.890
So I came to greet her.

00:16:25.890 --> 00:16:29.070
Wow, you are unusually well-mannered.

00:16:29.070 --> 00:16:31.070
Haruka is over there.

00:16:38.720 --> 00:16:39.940
Give me a minute.

00:16:39.940 --> 00:16:42.550
Hey you, come for practice!

00:16:43.850 --> 00:16:46.190
Okay. I'm sorry.

00:16:46.610 --> 00:16:48.430
Haruka, you have a guest.

00:16:49.510 --> 00:16:51.910
The male volleyball club is in despair.

00:16:51.910 --> 00:16:57.450
Someone has to tell Hosaka that fifty rounds around the track is impossible.

00:16:57.450 --> 00:16:59.620
I have to make dinner...

00:17:00.960 --> 00:17:02.950
You have business with Haruka, right?

00:17:03.330 --> 00:17:04.720
There you go!

00:17:10.250 --> 00:17:11.210
Haruka!

00:17:18.220 --> 00:17:19.900
I'm sorry.

00:17:20.370 --> 00:17:21.470
I'm sorry.

00:17:21.960 --> 00:17:24.860
I understand the situation since I've been watching.

00:17:25.410 --> 00:17:29.380
Everyone is staring at us, and I'm so embarrassed I want to leave this instant.

00:17:30.100 --> 00:17:34.570
But if we don't settle everything now, we won't be able to get over it, right?

00:17:34.570 --> 00:17:35.610
Is it okay with you?

00:17:35.610 --> 00:17:36.680
Okay.

00:17:46.450 --> 00:17:47.830
Help me taste this.

00:17:50.850 --> 00:17:53.350
Potato, chestnut, mushroom.

00:17:53.350 --> 00:17:54.940
Tastes refreshing and great,

00:17:54.940 --> 00:17:57.430
But too bad I can't smell its aroma.

00:17:58.360 --> 00:17:59.340
Natsuki?

00:17:59.660 --> 00:18:01.550
But this brings back memories.

00:18:01.550 --> 00:18:03.140
It smells of blood.

00:18:03.750 --> 00:18:05.230
You need more iron.

00:18:10.880 --> 00:18:14.120
Haruka-neesama's chopping sounds irregular.

00:18:14.120 --> 00:18:15.560
Did something happen?

00:18:17.140 --> 00:18:18.180
Minami-ke.

00:18:19.980 --> 00:18:24.070
So, Natsuki, did you manage to meet Haruka in school?

00:18:24.070 --> 00:18:28.580
I met her, but I got in trouble.

00:18:28.900 --> 00:18:30.670
What trouble?

00:18:30.670 --> 00:18:31.960
What happened?

00:18:38.810 --> 00:18:42.220
Today I'm going to Chiaki's house after school, want to come along?

00:18:44.410 --> 00:18:45.720
Are you listening?

00:18:51.830 --> 00:18:52.930
I'm here!

00:18:52.930 --> 00:18:54.120
Yo!

00:18:54.120 --> 00:18:55.220
Touma!

00:19:03.300 --> 00:19:05.300
Hey, Haruka, what's wrong?

00:19:05.300 --> 00:19:07.560
Touma, this is a good opportunity.

00:19:07.560 --> 00:19:08.950
Let me teach you something.

00:19:08.950 --> 00:19:11.730
Haruka is a lazy person at heart.

00:19:12.750 --> 00:19:14.710
You mean she's lazing now?

00:19:15.300 --> 00:19:19.790
When there's no one to egg her on, she becomes as lazy as one can get.

00:19:19.790 --> 00:19:22.800
Haruka came home the earliest today...

00:19:28.200 --> 00:19:30.950
Haruka must have thought,

00:19:30.950 --> 00:19:33.120
"Let's take a nap for now."

00:19:33.120 --> 00:19:36.770
"But maybe I should change before sleeping."

00:19:38.160 --> 00:19:41.760
"Nah, that's too troublesome, let's go to sleep like this."

00:19:45.440 --> 00:19:49.180
Huh? How do you know her thought process?

00:19:49.180 --> 00:19:50.600
Just look.

00:19:54.860 --> 00:19:57.380
Her third button is buttoned wrongly, isn't it?

00:19:57.900 --> 00:19:58.830
You're right.

00:19:58.830 --> 00:20:01.460
So she wanted to take off her clothes, but changed her mind?

00:20:04.360 --> 00:20:07.580
Today my second brother came to say hi.

00:20:07.580 --> 00:20:09.870
What? You should have said so earlier.

00:20:09.870 --> 00:20:12.420
He's outside, I'll go call him.

00:20:12.740 --> 00:20:13.970
Haruka, wake up!

00:20:14.300 --> 00:20:15.230
You're being rude.

00:20:16.330 --> 00:20:18.530
I'm Touma's elder brother, Natsuki.

00:20:18.530 --> 00:20:21.000
I apologize for what happened that day.

00:20:21.000 --> 00:20:24.100
Thank you for taking care of my sister all this while.

00:20:24.100 --> 00:20:26.700
Haruka, where are your manners? Wakey wakey!

00:20:38.610 --> 00:20:40.060
Welcome.

00:20:42.120 --> 00:20:44.500
Please raise your head.

00:20:47.470 --> 00:20:49.480
You're the one from back then...

00:20:50.930 --> 00:20:53.180
So you are Touma's brother!

00:20:53.180 --> 00:20:55.360
You didn't tell her that?

00:20:55.360 --> 00:20:59.680
Well, don't take that incident to heart, raise your head please.

00:21:01.440 --> 00:21:03.280
Do you hear me?

00:21:03.280 --> 00:21:05.130
Hey, you're being rude.

00:21:05.130 --> 00:21:09.130
Perhaps he'll be even ruder to you by raising his head?

00:21:09.830 --> 00:21:13.820
It's true that punching you for touching me was too much.

00:21:13.820 --> 00:21:15.830
That's because I was too surprised...

00:21:15.830 --> 00:21:19.240
Are you still making legends even after becoming a high school student?

00:21:19.760 --> 00:21:20.840
It-It's not like that.

00:21:21.880 --> 00:21:24.220
Haruka-neesama, your clothes, your clothes!

00:21:27.420 --> 00:21:30.200
Why didn't you tell me?!

00:21:30.200 --> 00:21:32.180
I told you discreetly!

00:21:32.180 --> 00:21:35.180
Oh shit! Natsuki's old wound is bleeding again!

00:21:36.280 --> 00:21:37.430
Oh no!

00:21:37.430 --> 00:21:39.300
Raise your head.

00:21:44.940 --> 00:21:48.200
He's still bleeding! Natsuki! It's not stopping!

00:21:48.200 --> 00:21:49.120
Are you alright?!

00:21:49.120 --> 00:21:50.370
Wipe it! Wipe it!

00:21:50.370 --> 00:21:52.630
Haruka-neesama, your clothes, your clothes!

00:21:52.630 --> 00:21:55.210
Dear viewers, remember to take your iron!

00:21:57.260 --> 00:21:59.670
I wanted to go too.

00:23:29.920 --> 00:23:30.930
Next Episode

00:23:30.930 --> 00:23:33.530
Senpai, next time is a story about Christmas.

00:23:33.530 --> 00:23:37.590
This means I'm Minami Haruka's Santa Claus, eh?

00:23:37.590 --> 00:23:38.520
But first I have to prepare the best clothes and reindeers,

00:23:38.520 --> 00:23:40.310
Of Christmas and Eves

00:23:40.310 --> 00:23:40.860
So that I can become a first-class Santa Claus.

00:23:40.860 --> 00:23:44.030
Next time: Of Christmas and Eves

00:23:44.030 --> 00:23:44.960
Of Christmas and Eves
